        ("voice-vocal-fatigue", "Recognize Vocal Fatigue and Rest", "unit-1", "intermediate", "Persistent effort, reduced range or a rough voice can signal fatigue. Rest, hydration and reduced vocal load are safer responses than pushing through discomfort.", "Pause a practice block when tone or comfort changes; resume only when speaking and singing feel normal"),
